//t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ihi491RQo5A", "tmdb_id": 309809, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 35, "title": "The Simpsons Movie", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3b8TZWwmkYc2KoJ5zk77qB6PzY.jpg", "rating": 7.023, "year": "2007", "overview": "After Homer accidentally pollutes the town's water supply, Springfield is encased in a gigantic dome by the EPA and the Simpsons are declared fugitives.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HVDieI6Dp2s", "tmdb_id": 35, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 788, "title": "Mrs. Doubtfire", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shHrSmXS5140o6sQzgzXxn3KqSm.jpg", "rating": 7.196, "year": "1993", "overview": "Loving but irresponsible dad Daniel Hillard, estranged from his exasperated spouse, is crushed by a court order allowing only weekly visits with his kids. When Daniel learns his ex needs a housekeeper, he gets the job -- disguised as a British nanny. Soon he becomes not only his children's best pal but the kind of parent he should have been from the start.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NBZ2ioWBxD8", "tmdb_id": 788, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 10527, "title": "Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agRbLOHgN46TQO4YdKR462iR7To.jpg", "rating": 6.535, "year": "2008", "overview": "Alex, Marty, and other zoo animals find a way to escape from Madagascar when the penguins reassemble a wrecked airplane. The precariously repaired craft stays airborne just long enough to make it to the African continent. There the New Yorkers encounter members of their own species for the first time. Africa proves to be a wild place, but Alex and company wonder if it is better than their Central Park home.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cSo0k5a0l0w", "tmdb_id": 10527, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 404368, "title": "Ralph Breaks the Internet", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVCrhBcpDaHGvv7CLYbK6PuXZo1.jpg", "rating": 7.15, "year": "2018", "overview": "Video game bad guy Ralph and fellow misfit Vanellope von Schweetz must risk it all by traveling to the World Wide Web in search of a replacement part to save Vanellope's video game, Sugar Rush. In way over their heads, Ralph and Vanellope rely on the citizens of the internet — the netizens — to help navigate their way, including an entrepreneur named Yesss, who is the head algorithm and the heart and soul of trend-making site BuzzzTube.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T73h5bmD8Dc", "tmdb_id": 404368, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 15121, "title": "The Sound of Music", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6CrUZypAsBCaRWX0M3RVRDbhNS.jpg", "rating": 7.7, "year": "1965", "overview": "In the years before World War II, a tomboyish postulant at an Austrian abbey is hired as a governess in the home of a widowed naval captain with seven children and brings a new love of life and music into the home.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q7wZClqWm_o", "tmdb_id": 15121, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 1266800, "title": "The Desert Child", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qPtHYpeRgRQUDVYk5M8X37Rkbb.jpg", "rating": 7.4, "year": "2026", "overview": "14-year-old Sun has written and successfully published a story based on an incredible story told by her late grandfather about a wild child called Hadara, who is saved by a group of ostriches when he becomes separated from his family in a storm, and is then raised in the desert amid a host of wild animals, including his best friend, a desert fox. When Sun is invited to travel to the Sahara by a local community who has heard about her book, she meets Kharouba, a Nomad girl of her own age, and realizes there may be much more to Hadara than just a character in a bedtime story.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SnpewAcDAzs", "tmdb_id": 1266800, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 508943, "title": "Luca", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9x4i9uKGXt8IiiIF5Ey0DIoY738.jpg", "rating": 7.772, "year": "2021", "overview": "Luca and his best friend Alberto experience an unforgettable summer on the Italian Riviera. But all the fun is threatened by a deeply-held secret: they are sea monsters from another world just below the water’s surface.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mYfJxlgR2jw", "tmdb_id": 508943, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 1593, "title": "Night at the Museum", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDsAAYf6Zn0yiAGJ6lYGs6hoZ4E.jpg", "rating": 6.6, "year": "2006", "overview": "Chaos reigns at the natural history museum when night watchman Larry Daley accidentally stirs up an ancient curse, awakening Attila the Hun, an army of gladiators, a Tyrannosaurus rex and other exhibits.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ltba1_-tRT4", "tmdb_id": 1593, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 12230, "title": "One Hundred and One Dalmatians", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSlYq6FrBUviGSEh8v4L9nrSnBT.jpg", "rating": 7.178, "year": "1961", "overview": "When a litter of dalmatian puppies are abducted by the minions of Cruella De Vil, the parents must find them before she uses them for a diabolical fashion statement.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d2ALWgaLypE", "tmdb_id": 12230, "_sec": "family"}, {"id": 23398, "title": "Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2tgUeWadVJs1g6zOCZgKRs8uWC.jpg", "rating": 5.66, "year": "2009", "overview": "Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville's twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school's music